(window.AeroSenseTranslations ||= []).push({"Wet Lab · Design":"濕實驗 · 設計","Biological Design":"生物設計","AeroSense is designed to convert an odorant-receptor response into a calcium-dependent fluorescence signal in HEK293 cells. The selected architecture comprises nine tuning-receptor plasmids and a shared GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)":"AeroSense 的設計目標，是在 HEK293 細胞中將氣味受體反應轉換成鈣離子依賴的螢光訊號。選定的架構包含九種調諧受體質體，以及共用的 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)","–DmOrco reporter plasmid on pcDNA3.1(+). The receptor cassette produces a separate IRES-dependent mCherry marker; the reporter cassette encodes one fusion protein. Common expression and assay contexts are intended to make receptor outputs comparable. This report presents the design rationale and sequence-check record, and distinguishes them from cellular expression, localization and ligand-response measurements. The principal unresolved question is whether coupling the reporter to Orco preserves channel function while providing a useful optical response.":"–DmOrco 報導質體，皆採用 pcDNA3.1(+) 骨架。受體表現盒產生獨立、由 IRES 驅動的 mCherry 標記；報導表現盒則編碼一條融合蛋白。共用的表現與測定條件，旨在讓受體輸出可相互比較。本報告呈現設計依據與序列檢查紀錄，並將其與細胞表現、定位及配體反應量測區分。主要尚待釐清的問題，是將報導蛋白接到 Orco 後，能否保留通道功能，同時提供有用的光學反應。","The Sense layer has to produce a comparable receptor-response vector, not a one-off fluorescence photograph. Those constraints, not sequence decoration, set the architecture.":"感測層必須產生可比較的受體反應向量，而非一次性的螢光照片。架構由這些限制條件決定，而不是為了讓序列看起來豐富。","Tuning receptor":"調諧受體","Each sensing cell needs one":"每個感測細胞需要一種","OR that supplies ligand specificity. Nine ORs are used so the array can span chemical classes without collapsing every odor onto a single receptor.":"OR，提供配體專一性。我們使用九種 OR，讓陣列涵蓋多種化學類別，避免所有氣味都只由單一受體判讀。","Orco channel support":"Orco 通道支援","Insect ORs are not GPCRs. The OR–Orco complex is a heteromeric ligand-gated ion channel":"昆蟲 OR 並非 GPCR。OR–Orco 複合體是一種異源多聚體配體門控離子通道",", so Orco must be present as functional channel support in the same cell as the tuning receptor.":"，因此 Orco 必須與調諧受體存在於同一細胞中，提供具功能的通道支援。","Optical conversion":"光學轉換","Channel opening must become an optical signal. GCaMP6f is the designed genetically encoded reporter of cytosolic Ca":"通道開啟必須轉換為光學訊號。GCaMP6f 是本設計中用來報導細胞質 Ca","Nine-receptor comparability":"九受體的可比較性","Downstream decoding needs a vector, not nine incompatible assays. Receptor identity may change; chassis, backbone, reporter architecture, and assay logic should not.":"下游解碼需要一個向量，而非九種彼此不相容的測定。受體種類可以改變；宿主、骨架、報導架構與測定邏輯則應一致。","Minimize unnecessary differences":"盡量減少不必要的差異","Only the OR open reading frame is intended to change across sensing plasmids. Promoter context, IRES marker, poly(A), and selection markers stay shared.":"各感測質體間預期只改變 OR 開放閱讀框。啟動子背景、IRES 標記、poly(A) 與篩選標記皆維持共用。","Standardized assay output":"標準化測定輸出","The designed product of a well is a normalized, comparable receptor-response — not an ad hoc microscope snapshot.":"每孔的設計產物是正規化且可比較的受體反應，而非臨時拍攝的顯微影像。","Ten plasmids implement that contract: nine OR sensing modules and one GCaMP6f–Orco reporting module, all on":"十個質體實現這套設計要求：九個 OR 感測模組與一個 GCaMP6f–Orco 報導模組，全部採用","pcDNA3.1(+)":"pcDNA3.1(+)","Insect ORs are not GPCRs. The OR–Orco complex is a":"昆蟲 OR 並非 GPCR。OR–Orco 複合體是一種","heteromeric ligand-gated ion channel":"異源多聚體配體門控離子通道","Sato et al., 2008 — full entry in References.":"Sato 等人，2008 年——完整條目見參考文獻。",", so no additional signal-transduction cascade is required in a heterologous host. When a VOC binds the tuning OR, the channel opens and extracellular Ca²⁺ enters the cell. GCaMP6f is a published genetically encoded indicator of cytosolic Ca²⁺":"，因此在異源宿主中不需要額外的訊息傳遞級聯。當 VOC 與調諧 OR 結合，通道開啟，細胞外 Ca²⁺ 進入細胞。GCaMP6f 是已發表的基因編碼細胞質 Ca²⁺ 指示蛋白","Chen et al., 2013 — full entry in References.":"Chen 等人，2013 年——完整條目見參考文獻。",", so the intended optical output of this architecture is a fluorescence rise. This provides a rationale for using HEK293 as a heterologous host. Successful readout still depends on receptor expression, membrane localization, channel function and reporter performance in our constructs.":"，因此此架構預期的光學輸出是螢光上升。這提供了採用 HEK293 作為異源宿主的依據。能否成功讀出，仍取決於我們構築中的受體表現、膜定位、通道功能與報導蛋白效能。","tuning OR + Orco":"調諧 OR + Orco","ligand-gated channel":"配體門控通道","extracellular Ca":"細胞外 Ca","influx":"流入","GCaMP6f fluorescence":"GCaMP6f 螢光","receptor-response vector":"受體反應向量","Engineering smell into light.":"將氣味轉換成光。","A VOC is recognised by a tuning OR assembled with Orco as a heteromeric ligand-gated ion channel":"VOC 由調諧 OR 辨識；該 OR 與 Orco 組成異源多聚體配體門控離子通道",". Channel opening admits extracellular Ca²⁺ into the cytoplasm, where N-terminal GCaMP6f reports the rise as fluorescence":"。通道開啟後，細胞外 Ca²⁺ 進入細胞質，位於 N 端的 GCaMP6f 以螢光報導其上升",". Compartment labels, hatch (OR), fill (Orco), and Ca²⁺ text mark meaning independently of colour.":"。區室標籤、斜線（OR）、填色（Orco）及 Ca²⁺ 文字，使圖意不只依賴顏色。","What to notice":"觀察重點","OR hatch vs Orco fill and Ca²⁺ text carry meaning without relying on colour alone.":"OR 的斜線、Orco 的填色與 Ca²⁺ 文字共同傳達意義，不只依賴顏色。","GCaMP6f is drawn on the cytosolic side — the design orientation for readout.":"GCaMP6f 畫在細胞質側，對應本設計的讀出方向。","This is a concept schematic, not an AeroSense assay trace or measured ΔF/F₀.":"這是概念示意圖，不是 AeroSense 測定軌跡或實測 ΔF/F₀。","Concept illustration — not experimental data":"概念插圖——非實驗數據","Attribution:":"出處：","Illustration by NTHU iGEM 2026. Mechanism drawn from Sato et al. (2008) and Chen et al. (2013); not copied from published figures.":"由 NTHU iGEM 2026 繪製。機制依據 Sato 等人（2008）及 Chen 等人（2013），並非複製已發表圖表。","Evidence status:":"證據狀態：","Design schematic, not an AeroSense assay trace.":"設計示意圖，並非 AeroSense 測定軌跡。","1. VOC recognition":"1. VOC 辨識","The tuning OR determines ligand specificity. Orco is the shared co-receptor in every sensing cell.":"調諧 OR 決定配體專一性。Orco 是每個感測細胞共用的共受體。","2. OR/Orco channel opening":"2. OR/Orco 通道開啟","Ligand binding opens the heteromeric cation channel. No GPCR second-messenger pathway is required.":"配體結合後開啟異源多聚體陽離子通道，不需要 GPCR 的第二傳訊者途徑。","3. Ca²⁺ influx":"3. Ca²⁺ 流入","Extracellular Ca²⁺ enters through the open channel into the cytosol.":"細胞外 Ca²⁺ 經由開啟的通道進入細胞質。","4. GCaMP6f fluorescence":"4. GCaMP6f 螢光","Cytosolic GCaMP6f is the intended optical reporter of that Ca²⁺ rise. This is the designed Sense-layer output, not a measured AeroSense trace.":"細胞質中的 GCaMP6f 是預期報導 Ca²⁺ 上升的光學指示蛋白。這是感測層的設計輸出，並非 AeroSense 的實測軌跡。","Two genetic modules, one living cell. Ligand identity and optical reporting are split so the same Orco–GCaMP6f reporter can pair with any one of the nine tuning receptors. The figure below is the only complete construct map on this page.":"兩個基因模組，共存於一個活細胞。配體辨識與光學報導分開設計，讓同一個 Orco–GCaMP6f 報導模組能搭配九種調諧受體中的任何一種。下圖是本頁唯一的完整構築圖。","Click a labelled block in Figure 2 to read its role, design rationale, and any caveat. The same notes remain in the cassette records below if JavaScript is off.":"點選圖 2 中有標籤的區塊，可閱讀其功能、設計依據與注意事項。關閉 JavaScript 時，下方表現盒紀錄仍保留相同說明。","Cassette inspector":"表現盒檢視器","Choose a labelled block in Figure 2. The panel shows the feature name, role, design rationale, and any caveat from the Design source.":"選擇圖 2 中有標籤的區塊。面板會顯示元件名稱、功能、設計依據，以及設計來源中的注意事項。","Two modules, one backbone.":"兩個模組，共用一種骨架。","Module 1 places mCherry after an EMCV IRES so the receptor and the red marker are separate proteins. Module 2 encodes one fusion protein, GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)":"模組 1 將 mCherry 放在 EMCV IRES 之後，讓受體與紅色標記成為不同蛋白質。模組 2 則編碼一條融合蛋白 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)","–DmOrco. Block labels identify each feature; coral marks mCherry and green marks GCaMP6f as secondary cues. Lengths are not to scale and are not used as sequence measurements.":"–DmOrco。區塊標籤辨識各元件；珊瑚色標示 mCherry，綠色標示 GCaMP6f，作為輔助線索。長度未依比例繪製，不作為序列長度量測。","Design map — not a sequenced chromatogram":"設計圖——非定序層析圖","Illustration by NTHU iGEM 2026 from the team Design source architecture.":"由 NTHU iGEM 2026 依團隊設計來源的架構繪製。","In this architecture, GCaMP6f is fused to Orco’s intracellular N-terminus so the indicator and co-receptor are one polypeptide. An IRES-driven sensor is expressed at a reduced level relative to the upstream cistron":"在此架構中，GCaMP6f 融合於 Orco 的細胞內 N 端，使指示蛋白與共受體成為同一條多胜肽。由 IRES 驅動的感測蛋白，相較於上游順反子，其表現量較低","Ibrahimi et al., 2009 — full entry in References.":"Ibrahimi 等人，2009 年——完整條目見參考文獻。",", which is why this module is a fusion rather than a bicistronic calcium reporter. OR–Orco channel assembly is the published detection mechanism":"，因此此模組採用融合形式，而非雙順反子鈣報導系統。OR–Orco 通道組裝是已發表的偵測機制","; this page does not report that assembly or trafficking has been measured in AeroSense cells. Parts inventory and Registry packaging live on":"；本頁並未報告已在 AeroSense 細胞中量測到此組裝或運送過程。元件清單與 Registry 整理內容見","Module 1 cassette inspector — OR sensing plasmids":"模組 1 表現盒檢視器——OR 感測質體","Nine plasmids share one cassette layout. Only the OR open reading frame changes. Figure 2 above is the complete map; this inspector is the accessible feature list.":"九個質體共用同一表現盒配置，僅 OR 開放閱讀框不同。上方圖 2 是完整構築圖；此檢視器提供無障礙元件清單。","Architecture":"架構","Accessible schematic of Module 1: CMV-driven odorant-receptor expression with EMCV IRES and the downstream mCherry marker on the shared pcDNA3.1(+) backbone. Select a feature to read its role; this is a design map, not a sequencing result.":"模組 1 的無障礙示意圖：CMV 驅動氣味受體表現，並於共用的 pcDNA3.1(+) 骨架上配置 EMCV IRES 與下游 mCherry 標記。選擇元件以閱讀其功能；這是設計圖，並非定序結果。","CMV enhancer/promoter → Kozak (":"CMV 增強子／啟動子 → Kozak（",") → OR ORF → STOP → EMCV IRES → mCherry → STOP → BGH poly(A), with SV40 promoter → NeoR, ColE1 ori, and AmpR on the shared backbone. Inventory:":"）→ OR ORF → 終止 → EMCV IRES → mCherry → 終止 → BGH poly(A)；共用骨架另含 SV40 啟動子 → NeoR、ColE1 ori 及 AmpR。清單：","Promoter":"啟動子","Kozak":"Kozak","Stop":"終止","Marker":"標記","3′ end":"3′ 端","BGH poly(A)":"BGH poly(A)","Module 1 inspector":"模組 1 檢視器","Select a cassette feature to read its role, design rationale, and any caveat from the Design source.":"選擇表現盒元件，以閱讀其功能、設計依據，以及設計來源中的注意事項。","Accessible cassette list matching Figure 2 — not a sequenced chromatogram":"對應圖 2 的無障礙表現盒清單——非定序層析圖","Bicistronic expression":"雙順反子表現","One CMV-driven mRNA encodes two separate proteins. Ribosomes translate the OR cap-dependently; the internal ribosome entry site then re-initiates translation of mCherry as an independent polypeptide. mCherry is therefore not fused to the receptor.":"一條由 CMV 驅動的 mRNA 編碼兩種獨立蛋白質。核糖體以帽端依賴方式轉譯 OR；接著，內部核糖體進入位點使 mCherry 以獨立多胜肽形式重新起始轉譯。因此 mCherry 並未與受體融合。","Module 1 plasmid specifications (lengths and selection markers)":"模組 1 質體規格（長度與篩選標記）","Sequence features of the OR–IRES–mCherry sensing cassette: backbone, coding lengths and selection markers. OR length varies with the receptor; these are design specifications, not expression measurements.":"OR–IRES–mCherry 感測表現盒的序列特徵：骨架、編碼長度與篩選標記。OR 長度依受體而異；這些是設計規格，並非表現量測。","Feature":"特徵","Backbone":"骨架","pcDNA3.1(+), 5,428 bp":"pcDNA3.1(+)，5,428 bp","Kozak sequence":"Kozak 序列","immediately 5′ of each ATG":"緊接於各 ATG 的 5′ 上游","OR open reading frame":"OR 開放閱讀框","1,164–1,242 bp (387–413 aa, receptor-dependent). Individual OR lengths are not listed here beyond that range.":"1,164–1,242 bp（387–413 aa，依受體而異）。此處除該範圍外，未列出各 OR 的個別長度。","587 bp":"587 bp","711 bp (236 aa, ~26 kDa)":"711 bp（236 aa，~26 kDa）","Total plasmid":"質體總長","≈ 7.9–8.0 kb":"≈ 7.9–8.0 kb","Mammalian selection":"哺乳類細胞篩選","NeoR (G418)":"NeoR（G418）","Bacterial selection":"細菌篩選","AmpR":"AmpR","Receptor panel and codon optimisation":"受體面板與密碼子最佳化","Nine tuning receptors were selected to span distinct chemical classes of plant and pathogen VOCs. The roster and the Zboray overlap are shown in":"選擇九種調諧受體，以涵蓋植物與病原 VOC 的不同化學類別。名單及與 Zboray 研究重疊的受體列於","Receptor panel":"受體面板","All nine ORFs are codon-optimised for human expression (CTG constitutes ~92% of leucine codons; GC3 ≈ 0.83). Native":"全部九個 ORF 皆針對人類細胞表現進行密碼子最佳化（CTG 佔白胺酸密碼子的 ~92%；GC3 ≈ 0.83）。原生","codon usage is a documented cause of poor OR expression in mammalian cells, and codon optimisation has been shown to rescue stable expression of otherwise non-functional insect ORs in HEK293":"密碼子使用偏好，是文獻記載造成 OR 在哺乳類細胞中表現不佳的原因；密碼子最佳化已被證明可在 HEK293 中，恢復原本無功能昆蟲 OR 的穩定表現","Roberts et al., 2021 — full entry in References.":"Roberts 等人，2021 年——完整條目見參考文獻。","What mCherry does and does not report":" mCherry 能報導與不能報導的資訊","Because mCherry is translated from the":"由於 mCherry 由","same transcript":"同一條轉錄本","but as a":"轉譯，但形成","separate protein":"獨立蛋白質",", red fluorescence above matched background supports expression of the bicistronic cassette. It does":"，超過匹配背景的紅色螢光，可支持雙順反子表現盒有表現。它","report receptor folding or trafficking to the plasma membrane. Receptor function requires a controlled response assay: VUAA1 tests the Orco-dependent pathway, while a reference ligand tests the tuning receptor. Red fluorescence alone does not establish cell viability or receptor function. See":"報導受體摺疊或運送至細胞膜的情形。受體功能需要有對照的反應測定：VUAA1 測試 Orco 依賴途徑，參考配體則測試調諧受體。僅有紅色螢光，無法確立細胞存活或受體功能。參見","Assay design for comparability":"以可比較性為目標的測定設計","Comparability is a design requirement, not a later analysis trick. The panel and the shared expression context are meant to keep the only intended biological variable the tuning OR.":"可比較性是設計要求，而非後續分析的技巧。面板與共用表現背景，旨在讓調諧 OR 成為唯一預期改變的生物變因。","Shared panel facts (codon optimisation, chemical-class span, Zboray overlap, no ligand claims) are written once under":"共用面板資訊（密碼子最佳化、涵蓋的化學類別、與 Zboray 的重疊，以及不宣稱配體特性）統一記錄於",". The only per-receptor distinction on this page is overlap with the Zboray et al. platform versus the remaining receptors.":"。本頁各受體間唯一的區分，是與 Zboray 等人平台重疊的受體，以及其餘受體。","Not listed as overlapping the Zboray et al. platform":"未列為與 Zboray 等人平台重疊","Or85b":"Or85b","Overlaps the Zboray et al. platform":"與 Zboray 等人平台重疊","Or67a":"Or67a","Or7a":"Or7a","Or59b":"Or59b","Or42a":"Or42a","Or98a":"Or98a","Or19a":"Or19a","Receptor detail":"受體詳細資訊","Select a receptor. The panel repeats only source-backed panel information: receptor identity, overlap with the Zboray comparator panel, and the codon-optimisation strategy shared by all nine ORFs.":"選擇受體。面板只重述有來源支持的資訊：受體身分、與 Zboray 比較面板的重疊，以及全部九個 ORF 共用的密碼子最佳化策略。","Only":"只有","overlap with the seven receptors characterised by Zboray":"與 Zboray 所鑑定的七種受體重疊","in this platform. The remaining seven do not overlap with that seven-receptor study. This comparison identifies validation work for our panel; it does not establish that these receptors have never been expressed in another heterologous system.":"於此平台。其餘七種與該七受體研究不重疊。此比較指出我們面板仍需進行的驗證工作，並不代表這些受體從未在其他異源系統中表現。","Notably, Zboray":"值得注意的是，Zboray","reported that some":"報告某些","OR lines expressed well and responded to VUAA1 yet gave no VOC-specific response; we therefore treat receptor-level functional validation as a distinct experimental milestone rather than an assumption.":"OR 細胞株表現良好且能回應 VUAA1，卻沒有 VOC 特異性反應；因此，我們將受體層級的功能驗證視為獨立實驗里程碑，而非預設成立。","No ligand specificities, potencies, or AeroSense response values are assigned to individual receptors on this page.":"本頁未為個別受體指定配體專一性、效價或 AeroSense 反應數值。","Why comparability is designed in":"為何在設計中納入可比較性","Exact volumes and timings belong on":"確切體積與時間安排見",". This list is the design contract.":"。本清單是設計要求。","Same mammalian chassis":"相同哺乳類細胞宿主","All team wet-lab experiments use HEK293. The same cell background is retained across receptor comparisons; passage, density and imaging conditions remain assay-level variables to record.":"團隊所有濕實驗皆使用 HEK293。比較受體時維持相同細胞背景；傳代次數、密度與成像條件仍是測定層級需要記錄的變因。","Same backbone":"相同骨架","All ten plasmids use pcDNA3.1(+).":"全部十個質體皆使用 pcDNA3.1(+)。","Same promoter context where applicable":"適用處採用相同啟動子背景","CMV enhancer/promoter and BGH poly(A) are shared.":"共用 CMV 增強子／啟動子及 BGH poly(A)。","Same reporter architecture":"相同報導架構","One GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)":"同一個 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)","–DmOrco ORF pairs with every sensing plasmid.":"–DmOrco ORF 搭配每個感測質體。","Same assay geometry":"相同測定幾何","Designed for a matched multiwell calcium-response format, not receptor-specific microscope recipes.":"設計採用匹配的多孔鈣反應格式，而非各受體專屬的顯微鏡配方。","Same stimulus / control framework":"相同刺激／對照架構","Vehicle, Orco agonist, and genetic negatives are defined as interpretation rules, not as completed measurements on this page.":"溶劑對照、Orco 致效劑與基因陰性對照在此被定義為判讀規則，並非本頁已完成的量測。","Same normalization method":"相同正規化方法","Responses are designed to be comparable after a shared VUAA1-referenced normalization on Experiments.":"設計上，依實驗頁面共用的 VUAA1 參考正規化後，反應應可相互比較。","Same downstream data schema":"相同下游資料格式","The intended product is a receptor-response vector that can be compared across the nine receptors after the shared normalization.":"預期產物是一個受體反應向量，在共用正規化後，可於九種受體間比較。","Module 2 cassette inspector — GCaMP6f–Orco reporter":"模組 2 表現盒檢視器——GCaMP6f–Orco 報導系統","One plasmid. One open reading frame. Not a bicistronic construct. Figure 2 above is the complete map; this inspector is the accessible feature list.":"一個質體。一個開放閱讀框。並非雙順反子構築。上方圖 2 是完整構築圖；此檢視器提供無障礙元件清單。","Final architecture":"最終架構","Accessible schematic of Module 2: the GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)₃–DmOrco reporting fusion, RSET leader and regulatory elements on the shared backbone. Select a feature to read its role; the map describes the proposed construct rather than a functional calcium-response measurement.":"模組 2 的無障礙示意圖：共用骨架上的 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)₃–DmOrco 報導融合蛋白、RSET 前導序列與調控元件。選擇元件以閱讀其功能；此圖描述提出的構築，並非功能性鈣反應量測。",") → RSET leader → GCaMP6f → (GGGGS)":"）→ RSET 前導序列 → GCaMP6f → (GGGGS)","linker → DmOrco → STOP → BGH poly(A), with SV40 promoter → NeoR and AmpR on the shared backbone.":"連接肽 → DmOrco → 終止 → BGH poly(A)；共用骨架另含 SV40 啟動子 → NeoR 及 AmpR。","Leader":"前導序列","Sensor":"感測器","Linker":"連接肽","DmOrco":"DmOrco","Module 2 inspector":"模組 2 檢視器","Module 2 plasmid specifications (lengths and sequence coordinates)":"模組 2 質體規格（長度與序列座標）","Sequence features of the GCaMP6f–linker–DmOrco reporting construct. Lengths and translation checks describe the supplied design; the source does not resolve the coordinate system for the listed GCaMP6f positions.":"GCaMP6f–連接肽–DmOrco 報導構築的序列特徵。長度與轉譯檢查描述所提供的設計；來源未釐清所列 GCaMP6f 位置使用的座標系統。","8,293 bp":"8,293 bp","Coding sequence":"編碼序列","2,856 bp → 951 aa, ≈ 105 kDa":"2,856 bp → 951 aa，≈ 105 kDa","Nucleotide positions 1,022–2,266 (RS20/M13 – cpEGFP – calmodulin). The Design source does not state whether that numbering is on the plasmid or on the coding sequence.":"核苷酸位置 1,022–2,266（RS20/M13 – cpEGFP – calmodulin）。設計來源未說明此編號對應質體或編碼序列。",", 15 aa flexible glycine–serine linker":"，15 aa 柔性甘胺酸–絲胺酸連接肽","486 aa, human codon-optimised":"486 aa，經人類密碼子最佳化","Internal stop codons":"內部終止密碼子","None (verified by":"無（已由","in silico":"電腦模擬","translation)":"轉譯驗證）","The current fusion architecture replaced an earlier bicistronic reporter design; see":"目前的融合架構取代了較早的雙順反子報導設計；參見","Engineering · Wet Lab":"工程 · 濕實驗","for the redesign evidence.":"以閱讀重新設計的證據。","N-terminal GCaMP6f — why topology matters":"N 端 GCaMP6f——拓樸為何重要","N-terminal placement of GCaMP6f is the central orientation decision in Module 2. It follows published receptor topology; it is not a claim that AeroSense has re-determined that topology.":"將 GCaMP6f 放在 N 端，是模組 2 的核心方向決策。此設計依循已發表的受體拓樸，並不宣稱 AeroSense 已重新測定此拓樸。","Insect ORs and Orco adopt an":"昆蟲 OR 與 Orco 採用","inverted membrane topology":"反向膜拓樸","relative to vertebrate GPCRs: the":"，相較於脊椎動物 GPCR，其","N-terminus is intracellular":"N 端位於細胞內","and the C-terminus extracellular":"，C 端位於細胞外","Benton et al., 2006 — full entry in References.":"Benton 等人，2006 年——完整條目見參考文獻。",", confirmed structurally by cryo-EM of Orco":"，Orco 的冷凍電子顯微鏡結構亦確認此點","Butterwick et al., 2018 — full entry in References.":"Butterwick 等人，2018 年——完整條目見參考文獻。","GCaMP6f must reside in the":"GCaMP6f 必須位於","cytosol":"細胞質","to sense the Ca²⁺ entering through the channel. Fusing it to Orco’s C-terminus would place the sensor in the extracellular space, where high extracellular Ca²⁺ would compromise its use as a reporter of the intended cytosolic transient.":"，才能感測經由通道進入的 Ca²⁺。若將其融合至 Orco 的 C 端，感測蛋白會位於細胞外空間；較高的細胞外 Ca²⁺ 會妨礙它報導預期的細胞質暫態變化。","Placing GCaMP6f N-terminally follows that topology, and it has a second, expected design consequence:":"將 GCaMP6f 放在 N 端符合此拓樸，並具有第二個預期的設計效果：","Literature-supported requirement:":"文獻支持的要求：","the sensor faces the cytoplasm.":"感測蛋白朝向細胞質。","Design hypothesis / expected benefit:":"設計假說／預期效益：","tethering may place the sensor near channel-associated Ca²⁺ entry and improve local reporting; the fusion could also impair folding or channel function. That comparison is a rationale, not an AeroSense measurement on this page.":"繫連可能讓感測蛋白靠近通道相關的 Ca²⁺ 入口，改善局部報導；融合也可能妨礙摺疊或通道功能。此比較是設計依據，並非本頁的 AeroSense 量測結果。","Orco orientation":"Orco 方向","Our orientation":"我們採用的方向","Why orientation matters":"方向為何重要","GCaMP6f is placed N-terminally, fused to Orco’s intracellular N-terminus in the cytoplasm, so the sensor faces the cytosol.":"GCaMP6f 置於 N 端，融合至 Orco 位於細胞質中的細胞內 N 端，因此感測蛋白朝向細胞質。","The N-terminus is intracellular and the C-terminus extracellular. Ca²⁺ influx from the extracellular space must be read in the cytosol, so a cytosolic calcium indicator is required. Fusing GCaMP6f to Orco’s C-terminus would expose the sensor to extracellular Ca²⁺ rather than the intended cytosolic transient.":"N 端位於細胞內，C 端位於細胞外。細胞外流入的 Ca²⁺ 必須在細胞質中讀出，因此需要細胞質鈣離子指示蛋白。若將 GCaMP6f 融合至 Orco 的 C 端，感測蛋白會接觸細胞外 Ca²⁺，而非預期的細胞質暫態變化。","Why GCaMP6f is fused at the intracellular N-terminus.":"為何將 GCaMP6f 融合於細胞內 N 端。","Insect ORs and Orco have an inverted topology relative to vertebrate GPCRs: N-terminus intracellular, C-terminus extracellular":"昆蟲 OR 與 Orco 的拓樸與脊椎動物 GPCR 相反：N 端位於細胞內，C 端位於細胞外",", confirmed structurally for Orco":"，Orco 的結構已確認此點",". GCaMP6f is therefore placed on the cytoplasmic N-terminus so it can sense channel Ca²⁺. A C-terminal fusion would expose the sensor to extracellular Ca²⁺ rather than the intended cytosolic transient. The local-microdomain advantage of tethering is a design hypothesis, not an AeroSense measurement.":"。因此 GCaMP6f 置於細胞質側 N 端，以感測通道引起的 Ca²⁺。C 端融合會使感測蛋白接觸細胞外 Ca²⁺，而非預期的細胞質暫態變化。繫連帶來局部微區域優勢的說法屬設計假說，並非 AeroSense 量測結果。","Schematic — not experimental data":"示意圖——非實驗數據","Illustration by NTHU iGEM 2026; topology based on Benton et al. (2006) and Butterwick et al. (2018). Not copied from published figures.":"由 NTHU iGEM 2026 繪製；拓樸依據 Benton 等人（2006）及 Butterwick 等人（2018），並非複製已發表圖表。","linker":"連接肽","The (GGGGS)":"(GGGGS)","linker was chosen to give GCaMP6f enough conformational freedom to undergo its Ca²⁺-driven change while keeping it close to the channel. Glycine is used for backbone flexibility and serine to keep the linker hydrophilic. Its conformation, susceptibility to cleavage and effect on channel function have not been measured in the fusion. The three repeats were synthesised with":"連接肽的選擇，旨在讓 GCaMP6f 有足夠構形自由度，進行 Ca²⁺ 驅動的變化，同時維持靠近通道。甘胺酸提供骨架柔性，絲胺酸使連接肽保持親水性。此融合蛋白中的連接肽構形、受切割的敏感性及其對通道功能的影響，皆尚未量測。三段重複序列合成時採用","diversified synonymous codons":"多樣化同義密碼子","to avoid a tandem DNA repeat, which is a common cause of synthesis failure and deletion.":"，以避免串聯 DNA 重複；這類重複常造成合成失敗與缺失。","RSET leader":"RSET 前導序列","The construct retains the short RSET leader (His":"此構築保留短 RSET 前導序列（His","+ T7 tag + Xpress epitope) carried by the parent GCaMP6f plasmid. It is kept as an N-terminal tagging utility: an intended anti-His handle for confirming full-length fusion protein by western blot at the expected ~105 kDa. This page does not report that the leader has been shown experimentally to be inert in AeroSense cells. That western blot is a planned identity check, not a result published on this page.":"+ T7 標籤 + Xpress 表位），來自原始 GCaMP6f 質體。保留它作為 N 端標記工具：預計利用 anti-His 抗體，在西方墨點法中確認預期 ~105 kDa 的全長融合蛋白。本頁未報告已在 AeroSense 細胞中實驗證明此前導序列不影響功能。該西方墨點檢查是計畫中的身分確認，並非本頁已發表的結果。","All ten plasmids use pcDNA3.1(+) in":"全部十個質體皆使用 pcDNA3.1(+)，宿主為",", the cell line used for the team’s wet-lab experiments. CMV drives the expression cassette, while the separate SV40 promoter drives the neomycin-resistance cassette. An SV40 origin requires SV40 large T antigen for episomal replication; no origin-dependent amplification benefit is assumed for this HEK293 workflow":"，這是團隊濕實驗使用的細胞株。CMV 驅動表現盒，獨立的 SV40 啟動子則驅動新黴素抗性表現盒。SV40 複製起點須有 SV40 大 T 抗原才能進行染色體外複製；本 HEK293 流程不預設能獲得依賴該複製起點的擴增效益","Shared pcDNA3.1(+) regulatory, selection and propagation elements and their intended roles in mammalian expression or bacterial cloning.":"共用 pcDNA3.1(+) 的調控、篩選及增殖元件，以及其在哺乳類表現或細菌選殖中的預期功能。","Element":"元件","Function":"功能","CMV enhancer/promoter":"CMV 增強子／啟動子","Strong constitutive transcription in HEK293":"在 HEK293 中驅動強且持續性的轉錄","mRNA termination and stabilisation":"mRNA 終止與穩定化","NeoR (SV40 promoter)":"NeoR（SV40 啟動子）","G418 selection of stable mammalian lines":"以 G418 篩選穩定哺乳類細胞株","AmpR / ColE1 ori":"AmpR / ColE1 ori","Propagation and selection in":"用於增殖與篩選，宿主為","T7 and BGH priming sites":"T7 與 BGH 引子結合位點","Sequencing across both insert junctions":"跨越插入片段兩端接合處進行定序","SV40 origin":"SV40 複製起點","Episomal replication requires SV40 large T antigen; no amplification benefit is assumed in our HEK293 experiments":"染色體外複製需要 SV40 large T antigen；我們的 HEK293 實驗不預設有擴增效益","The backbone was chosen":"所選骨架","without a WPRE element":"不含 WPRE 元件",". This records a construct decision; it does not establish approval of the complete construct or assay. Institutional and competition safety documentation is handled on":"。這是構築決策紀錄，不代表完整構築或測定已獲核准。機構與競賽安全文件列於","Safety and Security":"安全與保全","The selected architecture addresses expression and measurement as separate engineering problems. This table records the choices already described above, including the comparison architectures that would test their weakest assumptions.":"選定架構將表現與量測視為不同的工程問題。本表記錄上述選擇，以及可測試其中最薄弱假設的比較架構。","Design choices, alternatives and the observations needed to evaluate them.":"設計選擇、替代方案，以及評估它們所需的觀察。","Rationale":"依據","Comparison / alternative":"比較／替代方案","Risk or unknown":"風險或未知事項","Discriminating test":"可區分假說的測試","HEK293 host":"HEK293 宿主","A mammalian expression system compatible with our calcium-reporting strategy and published insect-OR workflows.":"與我們的鈣報導策略及已發表昆蟲 OR 流程相容的哺乳類表現系統。","Insect-cell or oocyte expression systems.":"昆蟲細胞或卵母細胞表現系統。","Host-dependent folding, trafficking and response; cell maintenance constrains deployment.":"摺疊、運送與反應受宿主影響；細胞維護也限制實際部署。","Matched expression, localization and agonist-response controls; see":"匹配的表現、定位與致效劑反應對照；參見","platform rationale":"平台選擇依據","Nine-receptor panel":"九受體面板","Keep a common expression context while varying the tuning OR.":"維持共用表現背景，同時改變調諧 OR。","A smaller validated panel; receptor substitutions.":"較小且已驗證的面板；替換受體。","Published responsiveness does not transfer automatically to every receptor or ligand.":"已發表的反應性不能自動套用至每種受體或配體。","Test each receptor against matched vehicle, Orco-only and positive controls.":"以匹配的溶劑對照、僅 Orco 對照及陽性對照測試各受體。","OR–IRES–mCherry as separate proteins":"OR–IRES–mCherry 形成獨立蛋白質","Expression marker without attaching mCherry directly to the tuning receptor.":"提供表現標記，同時避免將 mCherry 直接接到調諧受體。","A linked reporter or independent expression cassette.":"連接式報導蛋白或獨立表現盒。","Downstream IRES expression can differ; red fluorescence does not report membrane trafficking.":"下游 IRES 表現量可能不同；紅色螢光不反映膜運送。","Quantify transcript/protein expression and independently inspect localization.":"定量轉錄本／蛋白質表現，並獨立檢查定位。","GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)₃–Orco fusion":"GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)₃–Orco 融合蛋白","Couple reporter production to Orco in one open reading frame, following the weak first-generation IRES reporter.":"因第一代 IRES 報導系統訊號微弱，改以單一開放閱讀框讓報導蛋白與 Orco 一同產生。","Separate cytosolic GCaMP6f and Orco.":"分開表現的細胞質 GCaMP6f 與 Orco。","Fusion may alter folding, channel behavior or calcium reporting.":"融合可能改變摺疊、通道行為或鈣報導。","Compare ionomycin and VUAA1 responses under matched acquisition.":"在匹配的擷取條件下比較 ionomycin 與 VUAA1 反應。","N-terminal reporter":"N 端報導蛋白","The inferred intracellular N terminus motivates placing the calcium reporter there.":"推定 N 端位於細胞內，因此將鈣報導蛋白置於該處。","Separate reporter, or alternative topology only after verification.":"分開表現報導蛋白；其他拓樸則須先驗證。","Structural precedent does not establish the topology/function of our fusion.":"結構先例不能確立我們融合蛋白的拓樸／功能。","Localization and topology checks plus a controlled functional assay.":"定位與拓樸檢查，加上具對照的功能測定。","Human-oriented codon optimization":"以人類表現為目標的密碼子最佳化","Apply a consistent expression design across insect coding sequences.":"對昆蟲編碼序列採取一致的表現設計。","Native coding sequences.":"原生編碼序列。","Sequence optimization alone does not prove increased expression.":"僅有序列最佳化，不能證明表現增加。","Matched native/optimized comparison if expression remains limiting.":"若表現仍是限制因素，進行匹配的原生／最佳化比較。","Shared pcDNA3.1(+) backbone; no WPRE":"共用 pcDNA3.1(+) 骨架；不含 WPRE","CMV-driven cassettes in the documented common backbone.":"在記錄的共用骨架中，以 CMV 驅動表現盒。","A separately evaluated regulatory architecture.":"另行評估的調控架構。","Resistance survival cannot establish both plasmids in every cell.":"具抗性的存活不能證明每個細胞皆保有兩個質體。","Verify insert/junction sequences, reporter retention and dual-module function.":"確認插入片段／接合處序列、報導蛋白保留情形，以及雙模組功能。","Fluorescence is not automatically function. This section states the experimental":"螢光不會自動等同功能。本節說明讓九種受體可比較的實驗","logic":"邏輯","that makes nine receptors comparable. Exact volumes, timings, and instrument models belong on":"。確切體積、時間安排及儀器型號見","Can tell":"可以說明","mCherry can":"mCherry 可以","support evidence that the Module 1 cassette is transcribed and that the IRES has fired, because mCherry is a separate polypeptide from the same mRNA.":"支持模組 1 表現盒已轉錄且 IRES 已啟動的證據，因為 mCherry 是來自相同 mRNA 的獨立多胜肽。","GCaMP6f can":"GCaMP6f 可以","report calcium-dependent fluorescence when the indicator is in the cytosol and Ca²⁺ rises.":"在指示蛋白位於細胞質且 Ca²⁺ 上升時，報導鈣離子依賴的螢光。","A Ca²⁺ response to VUAA1":"對 VUAA1 的 Ca²⁺ 反應","is the intended functional readout of the Orco channel; a response to the tuning receptor’s reference ligand is the intended readout of OR specificity. Those assays are defined here as interpretation rules, not as completed measurements.":"是 Orco 通道預期的功能讀出；對調諧受體參考配體的反應，則是 OR 專一性的預期讀出。這些測定在此定義為判讀規則，並非已完成的量測。","Cannot tell":"不能說明","mCherry cannot":"mCherry 不能","by itself prove OR folding, plasma-membrane trafficking, or VOC responsiveness.":"單獨證明 OR 摺疊、運送至細胞膜或對 VOC 的反應性。","GCaMP fluorescence cannot":"GCaMP 螢光不能","be interpreted as OR/Orco function without controls that separate channel activity from reporter artifacts, vehicle effects, and expression failure.":"在缺乏適當對照時解讀為 OR/Orco 功能；對照必須將通道活性與報導蛋白假象、溶劑效應及表現失敗區分。","Neither reporter":"兩種報導蛋白皆不能","substitutes for receptor-level VOC validation. Zboray":"取代受體層級的 VOC 驗證。Zboray","observed VUAA1-positive lines that still lacked VOC-specific responses":"觀察到對 VUAA1 呈陽性、卻仍缺乏 VOC 特異性反應的細胞株","Experimental design logic":"實驗設計邏輯","Positive controls":"陽性對照","An Orco agonist (VUAA1) is the designed full-chain positive. A Ca":"Orco 致效劑（VUAA1）是設計中的完整訊號鏈陽性對照。Ca","ionophore (ionomycin) is the designed reporter-bypass positive if it is in the SOP — concentration is not frozen here.":"離子載體（ionomycin）若列入 SOP，則作為繞過通道、直接測試報導蛋白的陽性對照；本頁不固定其濃度。","Negative controls":"陰性對照","Untransfected / empty-vector cells, vehicle injection, and a Ca":"未轉染／空載體細胞、溶劑注入及無 Ca","-free condition are the designed ways to separate channel influx from sensor artefact or solvent effect.":"條件，是設計上用來區分通道流入與感測蛋白假象或溶劑效應的方法。","Replicates":"重複","Comparability requires biological and technical replication under the same plate/day reference, not a single well treated as a receptor identity.":"可比較性需要在相同孔盤／日期參考下進行生物與技術重複，不能將單一孔當作受體身分的代表。","Concentration range":"濃度範圍","The current protocol specifies a 1 / 10 / 100 µM series. Compound identities are not assigned on this page.":"目前流程指定 1 / 10 / 100 µM 系列。本頁未指定化合物身分。","Normalization":"正規化","Relative response":"相對反應","and plate/day VUAA1-normalized":"以及孔盤／日期的 VUAA1 正規化","norm":"norm","are the designed comparability transform. Formulas live on Experiments.":"是設計中建立可比較性的轉換。公式見實驗頁面。","Outlier policy":"離群值政策","Record technical failures and predefined image-quality exclusions with the raw data. Do not exclude fields because their signal is weak; any statistical outlier procedure requires a stated rationale and assumptions before use.":"將技術失敗與預先定義的影像品質排除，連同原始資料記錄。不可因訊號微弱而排除視野；任何統計離群值程序，都必須在使用前說明依據與假設。","No epitope tag on the receptors.":"受體不加表位標籤。","Final OR constructs carry no FLAG or trafficking tag. That keeps the receptor sequence minimal and avoids perturbing folding of a multipass membrane protein, but it means there is":"最終 OR 構築不帶 FLAG 或運送標籤。這使受體序列維持精簡，避免干擾多次跨膜蛋白的摺疊，但也代表","no OR-specific antibody handle":"沒有 OR 專一的抗體辨識標記",": tag-based localization is unavailable. An independent localization measurement would require a validated receptor-specific reagent or a revised tagged construct; function is assessed separately. Should trafficking prove limiting for a given receptor, published strategies — an N-terminal rhodopsin tag and ER-export signal":"：無法利用標籤進行定位。獨立定位量測需要經驗證的受體專一試劑，或修訂為帶標籤的構築；功能則另行評估。若某受體的運送成為限制因素，已有發表的策略——N 端 rhodopsin 標籤及 ER 輸出訊號","Miazzi et al., 2019 — full entry in References.":"Miazzi 等人，2019 年——完整條目見參考文獻。","— are available as a second-generation revision, not as part of the current constructs.":"——可作為第二代修訂方案，並非目前構築的一部分。","The EMCV poly(C) tract.":"EMCV poly(C) 區段。","The IRES region contains a 10× cytosine homopolymer. It is a known synthesis-difficulty region, but it is a genuine feature of the EMCV 5′ element and was deliberately retained rather than recoded.":"IRES 區域含有 10× 胞嘧啶同聚序列。這是已知難以合成的區域，但也是 EMCV 5′ 元件的真實特徵，因此刻意保留，未重新編碼。","Bicistronic expression ratio.":"雙順反子表現比例。","IRES-dependent mCherry and cap-dependent receptor expression can differ; their ratio has not been quantified in these cells. For an expression marker this is acceptable, since mCherry is bright and constitutive; it was explicitly":"IRES 依賴的 mCherry 與帽端依賴的受體表現可能不同；它們在這些細胞中的比例尚未定量。對表現標記而言，這可以接受，因為 mCherry 明亮且持續表現；但對微弱的鈣感測蛋白則明確","acceptable for a dim calcium sensor, which is why the Orco module uses a fusion instead.":"可接受，因此 Orco 模組改用融合形式。","Panel risk.":"面板風險。","Seven of nine receptors lie outside the comparator panel described by Zboray et al.; broader novelty has not been established by that comparison. Receptor-level VOC function is not assumed from expression or from VUAA1.":"九種受體中有七種不在 Zboray 等人描述的比較面板內；此比較並未確立更廣泛的新穎性。我們不根據表現或 VUAA1 反應，預設受體層級的 VOC 功能。","Separate expression, selection and function":"區分表現、篩選與功能","A fluorescence image answers a narrower question than a calcium-response experiment. GCaMP6f brightness depends on calcium as well as reporter abundance":"螢光影像能回答的問題，比鈣反應實驗更有限。GCaMP6f 亮度同時取決於鈣離子與報導蛋白含量","; a dim resting field cannot by itself distinguish low expression from low calcium. Similarly, mCherry supports expression only when separated from background and imaging artifacts. Cell death cannot be diagnosed from the red channel alone. The expression images and their acquisition limitations belong in":"；僅憑靜止狀態下的微弱視野，無法區分低表現與低鈣離子。同樣地，mCherry 只有在排除背景與成像假象後，才能支持表現。無法單憑紅色通道診斷細胞死亡。表現影像與其擷取限制見","G418 selection addresses enrichment of surviving, resistance-bearing cells. Because both plasmids share the same mammalian resistance marker, survival alone cannot prove that each cell retains both the sensing and reporter modules. Selection therefore needs to be interpreted alongside construct identity, expression and functional controls. A better-looking selected field is not, by itself, a quantitative improvement in transfection efficiency.":"G418 篩選用來富集存活且帶有抗性的細胞。由於兩個質體共用相同哺乳類抗性標記，存活本身不能證明每個細胞皆保留感測與報導兩個模組。因此，篩選需結合構築身分、表現與功能對照一同判讀。篩選後看起來更好的視野，本身不代表轉染效率有定量上的改善。","What would change the design?":"什麼結果會促使設計改變？","Reporter activity with a weak Orco-dependent response would prioritize channel expression and localization; absence of reporter activity would first require an independent check of reporter abundance and imaging sensitivity. If the fusion compromises function, a separately expressed cytosolic reporter is a comparison architecture. Linker and trafficking revisions should be evaluated against the current construct under matched conditions, with changes attributed to independent culture preparations rather than multiple fields from one well.":"若報導蛋白有活性，但 Orco 依賴反應微弱，應優先檢查通道表現與定位；若報導蛋白無活性，則應先獨立確認報導蛋白含量與成像靈敏度。若融合妨礙功能，分開表現的細胞質報導蛋白可作為比較架構。連接肽與運送修訂應在匹配條件下，與目前構築比較；變化應歸因於獨立培養製備，而非同一孔中的多個視野。","Sequence checks, synthesis, Sanger reads, and living-cell function are different claims. They are not collapsed into a single “Verified” status.":"序列檢查、合成、Sanger 讀序與活細胞功能，是不同主張，不能合併成單一「已驗證」狀態。","Evidence boundaries for the construct workflow, distinguishing recorded in-silico checks and synthesis statements from specified Sanger methods and pending functional validation.":"構築流程的證據界線：區分已記錄的電腦模擬檢查與合成敘述，以及指定的 Sanger 方法與待完成的功能驗證。","Layer":"層級","What this design source states":"此設計來源的敘述","Status on this page":"本頁狀態","In silico":"電腦模擬","Design check recorded":"已記錄設計檢查","All ten constructs were verified":"全部十個構築均已驗證","before synthesis — reading frame, absence of internal stop codons, Kozak context, junction integrity, and absence of internal sites for the intended cloning strategy. Every codon-optimised coding sequence was translated and compared against its FlyBase reference; all encode proteins identical to the reference.":"於合成之前——包含閱讀框、無內部終止密碼子、Kozak 背景、接合處完整性，以及預定選殖策略所需的內部位點不存在。每條密碼子最佳化編碼序列皆經轉譯，並與其 FlyBase 參考序列比較；全部編碼蛋白皆與參考一致。","In silico identity and frame checks, as stated. No sequence files are embedded here.":"依來源所述，已進行電腦模擬的身分與閱讀框檢查。本頁未嵌入序列檔案。","Synthesis":"合成","Constructs as synthesised":"已合成的構築","The page describes the":"本頁描述","final constructs as synthesised":"已合成的最終構築",": ten plasmids on pcDNA3.1(+).":"：十個採用 pcDNA3.1(+) 的質體。","Construct-status statement from the design source. Not functional validation.":"來自設計來源的構築狀態敘述，並非功能驗證。","Sanger":"Sanger","Method specified":"已指定方法","Sanger verification method (primers, linker-crossing read) is specified on":"Sanger 驗證方法（引子、跨連接肽讀序）列於",". Completion of those reads is not claimed on this page.":"。本頁未宣稱已完成這些讀序。","Plan / method. Completion of those reads is not claimed on this page.":"計畫／方法。本頁未宣稱已完成這些讀序。","Not claimed here":"本頁未宣稱","Functional OR expression is defined as a calcium response (VUAA1 for Orco; reference ligand for the tuning receptor). Receptor-level functional validation is a distinct experimental milestone.":"具功能的 OR 表現定義為鈣反應（VUAA1 用於 Orco；參考配體用於調諧受體）。受體層級功能驗證是獨立實驗里程碑。","See":"參見",". Do not read this Design page as a completed VUAA1 or VOC dataset.":"。不可將本設計頁面解讀為已完成的 VUAA1 或 VOC 資料集。","This page stops at architecture and design rationale.":"本頁止於架構與設計依據。","owns reusable components;":"負責可重複使用的元件；","owns DBTL iterations;":"負責 DBTL 迭代；","owns protocols;":"負責操作流程；","owns biological evidence.":"負責生物證據。","Assay procedures, transfection, and the control matrix that makes GCaMP and mCherry interpretable.":"測定程序、轉染，以及讓 GCaMP 與 mCherry 可判讀的對照矩陣。","Measured biological evidence only. Design rationale is not a result.":"僅呈現實測生物證據。設計依據不是結果。","Engineering · iterations":"工程 · 迭代","Vector rescue, reporter redesign, and fusion testing as Build/Test/Learn cycles.":"以構建／測試／學習循環進行載體挽救、報導系統重新設計及融合測試。","Notebook · chronology":"實驗紀錄 · 時序","Dated wet-lab records. Not a substitute for Design or Results.":"附日期的濕實驗紀錄，不能取代設計或結果頁面。","Role, rationale, and caveats for every labelled cassette feature. The inspector copies these notes when JavaScript is available.":"各個有標籤的表現盒元件，其功能、依據與注意事項。啟用 JavaScript 時，檢視器會複製這些說明。","Role.":"功能。","Strong constitutive transcription in HEK293.":"在 HEK293 中驅動強且持續性的轉錄。","Design rationale.":"設計依據。","All ten plasmids use the same vector, which simplifies cloning, sequencing, and selection. This is a bicistronic design: one CMV-driven mRNA encodes two separate proteins.":"全部十個質體使用同一載體，簡化選殖、定序與篩選。這是雙順反子設計：一條由 CMV 驅動的 mRNA 編碼兩種獨立蛋白質。","Kozak (":"Kozak（","Kozak sequence immediately 5′ of each ATG.":"緊接於各 ATG 之 5′ 上游的 Kozak 序列。","is placed immediately 5′ of each ATG. In silico sequence checks include Kozak context.":"置於各 ATG 的緊鄰 5′ 上游。電腦模擬序列檢查包含 Kozak 背景。","One":"一種","Drosophila melanogaster":"Drosophila melanogaster","odorant receptor, which confers ligand specificity.":"氣味受體，提供配體專一性。","Nine plasmids share one cassette layout. Only the OR open reading frame changes. Length is 1,164–1,242 bp (387–413 aa, receptor-dependent). Codon optimisation:":"九個質體共用同一表現盒配置，僅 OR 開放閱讀框不同。長度為 1,164–1,242 bp（387–413 aa，依受體而異）。密碼子最佳化：","Caveat.":"注意事項。","Final OR constructs carry no FLAG or trafficking tag. This keeps the receptor sequence minimal and avoids perturbing the folding of a multipass membrane protein, but it means there is no OR-specific antibody handle: tag-based localization is unavailable. Independent localization would require a validated receptor-specific reagent or a revised tagged construct; function is assessed separately. No ligand specificities are assigned to individual receptors on this page.":"最終 OR 構築不帶 FLAG 或運送標籤。這使受體序列維持精簡，避免干擾多次跨膜蛋白的摺疊，但也代表沒有 OR 專一的抗體辨識標記，無法利用標籤定位。獨立定位需要經驗證的受體專一試劑，或修訂為帶標籤的構築；功能則另行評估。本頁未為個別受體指定配體專一性。","STOP (after OR ORF)":"終止密碼子（OR ORF 之後）","Terminates the receptor open reading frame so OR and mCherry are separate proteins.":"終止受體開放閱讀框，使 OR 與 mCherry 成為獨立蛋白質。","Architecture: CMV enhancer/promoter → Kozak (":"架構：CMV 增強子／啟動子 → Kozak（",") → OR ORF → STOP → EMCV IRES → mCherry → STOP → BGH poly(A). One CMV-driven mRNA encodes two separate proteins.":"）→ OR ORF → 終止 → EMCV IRES → mCherry → 終止 → BGH poly(A)。一條由 CMV 驅動的 mRNA 編碼兩種獨立蛋白質。","Internal ribosome entry site that re-initiates translation of mCherry as an independent polypeptide.":"內部核糖體進入位點，使 mCherry 以獨立多胜肽形式重新起始轉譯。","Ribosomes translate the OR cap-dependently; the IRES then re-initiates mCherry. Specification: 587 bp.":"核糖體以帽端依賴方式轉譯 OR；IRES 隨後重新起始 mCherry 轉譯。規格：587 bp。","The IRES region contains a 10× cytosine homopolymer. It is a known synthesis-difficulty region, but it is a genuine feature of the EMCV 5′ element and was deliberately retained rather than recoded. IRES-dependent mCherry and cap-dependent receptor expression can differ; their ratio has not been quantified in these cells. For an expression marker this is acceptable, since mCherry is bright and constitutive; it was explicitly":"IRES 區域含有 10× 胞嘧啶同聚序列。這是已知難以合成的區域，但也是 EMCV 5′ 元件的真實特徵，因此刻意保留，未重新編碼。IRES 依賴的 mCherry 與帽端依賴的受體表現可能不同；它們在這些細胞中的比例尚未定量。對表現標記而言，這可以接受，因為 mCherry 明亮且持續表現；但對微弱鈣感測蛋白則明確","acceptable for a dim calcium sensor.":"可接受。","Bicistronic transcription / IRES marker (711 bp; 236 aa, ~26 kDa).":"雙順反子轉錄／IRES 標記（711 bp；236 aa，~26 kDa）。","Because mCherry is translated from the same transcript but as a separate protein, red fluorescence above matched background supports expression of the bicistronic cassette.":"由於 mCherry 由相同轉錄本轉譯，卻形成獨立蛋白質，超過匹配背景的紅色螢光可支持雙順反子表現盒有表現。","It does not report receptor folding or trafficking to the plasma membrane. Receptor function requires a controlled response assay: VUAA1 tests the Orco-dependent pathway, while a reference ligand tests the tuning receptor. Red fluorescence alone does not establish cell viability or receptor function.":"它不會報導受體摺疊或運送至細胞膜的情形。受體功能需要有對照的反應測定：VUAA1 測試 Orco 依賴途徑，參考配體則測試調諧受體。單有紅色螢光，無法確立細胞存活或受體功能。","STOP (after mCherry)":"終止密碼子（mCherry 之後）","Terminates the mCherry open reading frame so the marker is a separate protein.":"終止 mCherry 開放閱讀框，使標記成為獨立蛋白質。","Architecture places STOP after mCherry, before BGH poly(A). mCherry is therefore not fused to the receptor.":"架構將終止密碼子放在 mCherry 之後、BGH poly(A) 之前。因此 mCherry 並未與受體融合。","mRNA termination and stabilisation.":"mRNA 終止與穩定化。","Shared on the pcDNA3.1(+) backbone with T7 and BGH priming sites for sequencing across both insert junctions.":"與 T7 及 BGH 引子結合位點共存於 pcDNA3.1(+) 骨架，用於跨越插入片段兩端接合處的定序。","All ten plasmids use the same vector. Module 2 is a single open reading frame encoding one fusion protein — not a bicistronic construct.":"全部十個質體使用同一載體。模組 2 是單一開放閱讀框，編碼一條融合蛋白，並非雙順反子構築。","is placed immediately 5′ of the fusion ATG. In silico sequence checks include Kozak context.":"置於融合蛋白 ATG 的緊鄰 5′ 上游。電腦模擬序列檢查包含 Kozak 背景。","Short leader (His":"短前導序列（His","+ T7 tag + Xpress epitope) retained from the parent GCaMP6f plasmid.":"+ T7 標籤 + Xpress 表位），保留自原始 GCaMP6f 質體。","It is retained from the parent GCaMP6f plasmid as an intended anti-His handle for confirming full-length fusion protein by western blot at the expected ~105 kDa. This page does not report experimental inertness in AeroSense cells.":"保留原始 GCaMP6f 質體的此序列，是預計利用 anti-His 抗體，在西方墨點法中確認預期 ~105 kDa 的全長融合蛋白。本頁未報告已在 AeroSense 細胞中實驗證明其不影響功能。","That western blot is a planned identity check, not a result published on this page.":"該西方墨點檢查是計畫中的身分確認，並非本頁已發表的結果。","Genetically encoded calcium indicator (nucleotide positions 1,022–2,266; RS20/M13 – cpEGFP – calmodulin). The Design source does not state whether that numbering is on the plasmid or on the coding sequence.":"基因編碼鈣離子指示蛋白（核苷酸位置 1,022–2,266；RS20/M13 – cpEGFP – calmodulin）。設計來源未說明此編號對應質體或編碼序列。","N-terminal cytosolic placement — see":"位於細胞質的 N 端配置——參見","Module 2 · topology":"模組 2 · 拓樸","GCaMP6f is intrinsically dim at resting Ca²⁺ and its signal is transient, which is why an IRES-driven sensor was not used in this module.":"GCaMP6f 在靜止 Ca²⁺ 條件下本來就較暗，且訊號為暫態，因此此模組不使用 IRES 驅動的感測蛋白。","15 aa flexible glycine–serine linker between GCaMP6f and DmOrco.":"GCaMP6f 與 DmOrco 之間的 15 aa 柔性甘胺酸–絲胺酸連接肽。","The linker was chosen to give GCaMP6f enough conformational freedom to undergo its Ca²⁺-driven change while keeping it close to the channel. Glycine is used for backbone flexibility and serine to keep the linker hydrophilic. Its conformation, susceptibility to cleavage and effect on channel function remain unmeasured in the fusion. The three repeats were synthesised with diversified synonymous codons to avoid a tandem DNA repeat, which is a common cause of synthesis failure and deletion.":"選擇此連接肽，旨在讓 GCaMP6f 有足夠構形自由度，進行 Ca²⁺ 驅動的變化，同時維持靠近通道。甘胺酸提供骨架柔性，絲胺酸使連接肽保持親水性。此融合蛋白中的連接肽構形、受切割的敏感性及其對通道功能的影響，皆尚未量測。三段重複序列合成時採用多樣化同義密碼子，避免串聯 DNA 重複；這類重複常造成合成失敗與缺失。","Universal co-receptor. 486 aa, human codon-optimised.":"通用共受體。486 aa，經人類密碼子最佳化。","The reporting module is Orco fused to GCaMP6f as one protein: GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)":"報導模組將 Orco 與 GCaMP6f 融合為一條蛋白質：GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)","–DmOrco. Insect ORs are not GPCRs; the OR–Orco complex is a heteromeric ligand-gated ion channel.":"–DmOrco。昆蟲 OR 並非 GPCR；OR–Orco 複合體是異源多聚體配體門控離子通道。","Terminates the single fusion open reading frame.":"終止單一融合蛋白開放閱讀框。","Module 2 is one ORF, not a bicistronic construct. Internal stop codons: none (verified by":"模組 2 是一個 ORF，並非雙順反子構築。內部終止密碼子：無（已由","translation).":"轉譯驗證）。","The nine tuning receptors, with only the Zboray-overlap distinction assigned on this page. Shared codon-optimisation and chemical-class span:":"九種調諧受體；本頁只區分是否與 Zboray 研究重疊。共用的密碼子最佳化與涵蓋的化學類別：",". Only":"。只有","in this platform. The remaining seven do not overlap with that seven-receptor study. This comparison identifies validation work for our panel; it does not establish that these receptors have never been expressed in another heterologous system. No ligand specificities, potencies, or AeroSense response values are assigned to individual receptors on this page.":"於此平台。其餘七種與該七受體研究不重疊。此比較指出我們面板仍需進行的驗證工作，並不代表這些受體從未在其他異源系統中表現。本頁未為個別受體指定配體專一性、效價或 AeroSense 反應數值。","Not listed as overlapping the Zboray et al. platform.":"未列為與 Zboray 等人平台重疊。","Overlaps the Zboray et al. platform.":"與 Zboray 等人平台重疊。","The design provides a consistent way to exchange the tuning receptor while retaining a common reporter and expression backbone. It also gives the experiments a diagnostic structure: verify the construct, identify expression, test reporter competence, and then test Orco- and ligand-dependent responses. Demonstrating these steps in HEK293 is the route from a plausible cassette architecture to a characterized receptor collection.":"此設計提供一致的方法，可交換調諧受體，同時保留共用報導系統與表現骨架。它也為實驗建立診斷架構：確認構築、辨識表現、測試報導蛋白能力，再測試 Orco 與配體依賴反應。在 HEK293 中證明這些步驟，是從合理表現盒架構走向經鑑定受體集合的途徑。","cassette feature record":"表現盒元件紀錄","receptor notes":"受體說明","provide accessible counterparts to the interactive diagrams.":"提供互動圖示的無障礙對應內容。","links the component inventory and Registry records;":"連結元件清單與 Registry 紀錄；","documents the workflow;":"記錄工作流程；","records the vector and reporter revisions. The verification table above reports the source record’s sequence checks. This page does not supply raw Sanger chromatograms, a localization assay or a replicated VOC-response dataset; biological images and available analysis files are indexed on":"記錄載體與報導系統修訂。上方驗證表呈現來源紀錄的序列檢查。本頁不提供原始 Sanger 層析圖、定位測定或具有重複的 VOC 反應資料集；生物影像與可用分析檔案索引見",". Schematics are explanatory drawings and should not be used as sequence or structural measurements.":"。示意圖用於解說，不應作為序列或結構量測。","Designed signal path":"設計中的訊號路徑","Figure 1. Horizontal schematic of VOC recognition through GCaMP6f fluorescence. Scroll sideways on a narrow screen.":"圖 1. VOC 辨識至 GCaMP6f 螢光的橫向示意圖。窄螢幕可左右捲動。","Odor sensing mechanism":"氣味感測機制","Figure 2. Linear maps of Module 1 and Module 2. Scroll sideways on a narrow screen.":"圖 2. 模組 1 與模組 2 的線性構築圖。窄螢幕可左右捲動。","Module 1 elements from 5′ to 3′":"模組 1 的元件，依 5′ 至 3′ 排列","Module 1 plasmid specifications":"模組 1 質體規格","Module 2 elements from 5′ to 3′":"模組 2 的元件，依 5′ 至 3′ 排列","Module 2 plasmid specifications":"模組 2 質體規格","Figure 4. Orco membrane topology with N-terminal GCaMP6f. Scroll sideways on a narrow screen if needed.":"圖 4. 帶有 N 端 GCaMP6f 的 Orco 膜拓樸。窄螢幕必要時可左右捲動。","pcDNA3.1(+) elements and functions":"pcDNA3.1(+) 元件與功能","Verification layers for the Design constructs":"設計構築體的驗證層級","Biological Design · AeroSense · NTHU iGEM 2026":"生物設計 · AeroSense · NTHU iGEM 2026","The original design documented here couples insect receptors to calcium-dependent fluorescence in HEK293. It comprises nine tuning-receptor plasmids and one GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)":"本頁記錄的原始設計將昆蟲受體與 HEK293 中的鈣離子相依螢光相連，包括九個調諧受體質體，以及一個 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)","3":"3","–DmOrco reporter on pcDNA3.1(+). mCherry is a separate IRES-dependent marker; the reporter is one fusion protein.":"–DmOrco 報導質體，均使用 pcDNA3.1(+)。mCherry 是獨立的 IRES 相依標記；報導模組則是一條融合蛋白。","Results":"Results","presents the cellular measurements.":"呈現細胞量測；","Parts lists the current collection":"Parts 列出現行元件集",".":"。","The original design documented here couples insect receptors to calcium-dependent fluorescence in HEK293. It comprises nine tuning-receptor plasmids and one GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)3–DmOrco reporter on pcDNA3.1(+). mCherry is a separate IRES-dependent marker; the reporter is one fusion protein. Results presents the cellular measurements. Parts lists the current collection.":"本頁記錄的原始設計將昆蟲受體與 HEK293 中的鈣離子相依螢光相連，包括九個調諧受體質體，以及一個 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)3–DmOrco 報導質體，均使用 pcDNA3.1(+)。mCherry 是獨立的 IRES 相依標記；報導模組則是一條融合蛋白。Results呈現細胞量測；Parts 列出現行元件集。","The nine receptors shown here share the original HEK293 chassis and GCaMP6f–Orco reporter design. The":"本頁展示的九個受體共用原設計的 HEK293 宿主與 GCaMP6f–Orco 報導模組。","current Parts catalogue":"現行 Parts 目錄","also includes the Or67b insert design. Dashed branches lead to":"另收錄 Or67b 插入片段設計。虛線分支連至","Future work":"未來工作","The nine receptors shown here share the original HEK293 chassis and GCaMP6f–Orco reporter design. The current Parts catalogue also includes the Or67b insert design. Dashed branches lead to Future work.":"本頁展示的九個受體共用原設計的 HEK293 宿主與 GCaMP6f–Orco 報導模組。現行 Parts 目錄另收錄 Or67b 插入片段設計。虛線分支連至未來工作。","G418 enriches surviving, resistance-bearing cells. Because both plasmids share the resistance marker, survival cannot prove retention of both modules. Interpret selection alongside construct identity, expression and functional controls; a better-looking field does not quantify improved transfection efficiency.":"G418 富集存活且具抗性的細胞。兩個質體使用相同抗性標記，因此存活不能證明同時保留兩個模組。篩選須與構築身分、表現及功能對照一起判讀；視野看起來較好，並不等於轉染效率定量提升。","Reporter activity with weak Orco-dependent response would prioritize channel expression and localization. Absent reporter activity first requires independent checks of abundance and imaging sensitivity. Compare fusion, linker or trafficking revisions under matched conditions, using independent cultures rather than fields from one well; a separate cytosolic reporter provides an alternative if fusion compromises function.":"報導蛋白有活性但 Orco 相依反應弱，會優先檢查通道表現與定位；缺少報導活性則先獨立檢查含量與成像靈敏度。融合、連接肽或運輸修訂須在配對條件下比較，以獨立培養而非同孔多個視野作為重複；若融合妨礙功能，可另行比較獨立的胞質報導蛋白。","The architecture exchanges tuning receptors while retaining a common reporter and backbone. Characterizing it in HEK293 requires construct verification, expression and reporter checks, followed by Orco- and ligand-dependent response tests.":"此架構在替換調諧受體時，保留共用報導模組與骨架。在 HEK293 中完成鑑定，需要構築驗證、表現與報導蛋白檢查，再進行 Orco 及配體相依反應測試。","Original panel, nine receptors":"原始感測面板：九個受體","VOC recognition":"VOC 辨識","An odor molecule meets the tuning OR. The OR contributes ligand selectivity.":"氣味分子接觸調諧型 OR。OR 提供配體選擇性。","An odor molecule meets the tuning":"氣味分子接觸調諧型",". The OR contributes ligand selectivity.":"。OR 提供配體選擇性。","OR · Orco channel":"OR · Orco 通道","Orco channel":"Orco 通道","The tuning OR and Orco form a heteromeric ligand-gated cation channel. The tuning OR helps determine odor selectivity; Orco is the conserved co-receptor and channel partner.":"調諧型 OR 與 Orco 形成異源多聚體配體門控陽離子通道。調諧型 OR 協助決定氣味選擇性；Orco 是保守的共同受體與通道夥伴。","Ca²⁺ enters the cell":"Ca²⁺ 進入細胞","Channel opening permits extracellular Ca²⁺ to enter the cytosol.":"通道開啟後，細胞外 Ca²⁺ 可進入細胞質。","GCaMP6f reports Ca²⁺":"GCaMP6f 回報 Ca²⁺","Calcium binding changes the calmodulin/M13 arrangement around GCaMP6f’s circularly permuted fluorescent protein, increasing green fluorescence. mCherry marks expression in red and is not the Ca²⁺ readout.":"鈣離子結合會改變 GCaMP6f 環狀置換螢光蛋白周圍的鈣調蛋白／M13 排列，使綠色螢光增強。mCherry 以紅色標示表現，並非 Ca²⁺ 讀值來源。","Sensing mechanism steps":"感測機制步驟","3. Ca²⁺ entry":"3. Ca²⁺ 流入","EXTRACELLULAR SPACE":"細胞外空間","CYTOSOL":"細胞質","Cell membrane":"細胞膜","Odor molecule":"氣味分子","Tuning OR":"調諧型 OR","Odor-gated cation channel":"氣味門控陽離子通道","(GGGGS)₃ linker":"(GGGGS)₃ 連接肽","Ca²⁺-dependent green fluorescence":"依賴 Ca²⁺ 的綠色螢光","Separate expression marker":"獨立表現標記","Not the calcium readout":"並非鈣離子讀值來源","Odor → channel → calcium → light":"氣味 → 通道 → 鈣離子 → 光","1. Odor recognition":"1. 氣味辨識","2. OR + Orco channel":"2. OR + Orco 通道","3. Calcium entry":"3. 鈣離子流入","mCherry: separate red expression marker.":"mCherry：獨立的紅色表現標記。","MODULE 1 · BICISTRONIC SENSING CASSETTE · 5′ → 3′":"模組 1 · 雙順反子感測表現盒 · 5′ → 3′","PROMOTER":"啟動子","KOZAK":"Kozak 序列","STOP":"終止","MARKER":"標記","3′ END":"3′ 端","One CMV mRNA → two proteins. OR is cap-dependent; mCherry is IRES-dependent. Not drawn to scale.":"一條 CMV mRNA → 兩種蛋白質。OR 轉譯依賴帽結構；mCherry 轉譯依賴 IRES。未按比例繪製。","MODULE 2 · SINGLE-ORF REPORTER · 5′ → 3′":"模組 2 · 單一 ORF 報導蛋白 · 5′ → 3′","LEADER":"前導序列","SENSOR":"感測器","LINKER":"連接肽","One open reading frame: GCaMP6f fused to Orco. Shared pcDNA3.1(+) backbone (NeoR / AmpR not shown). Not drawn to scale.":"一個開放讀框：GCaMP6f 與 Orco 融合。共用 pcDNA3.1(+) 骨架（未顯示 NeoR／AmpR）。未按比例繪製。","EXTRACELLULAR":"細胞外","PLASMA MEMBRANE":"細胞膜","CYTOPLASM":"細胞質","C-terminus (extracellular)":"C 端（細胞外）","pore":"孔道","Ca2+ influx":"Ca2+ 流入","N-terminus":"N 端","intracellular":"細胞內","cytosolic Ca2+ sensor":"細胞質 Ca2+ 感測器","Our orientation: GCaMP6f on the cytosolic N-terminus":"我們的方向配置：GCaMP6f 位於朝向細胞質的 N 端","WHY ORIENTATION MATTERS":"為何方向配置重要","N-terminus intracellular":"N 端位於細胞內","C-terminus extracellular":"C 端位於細胞外","Ca2+ influx through the pore":"Ca2+ 經孔道流入","cytosolic indicator required":"需要位於細胞質的指示器","inverted topology [6]":"反向拓樸 [6]","Orco cryo-EM [7]":"Orco 冷凍電子顯微鏡結構 [7]","Schematic — not a cryo-EM reconstruction or AeroSense structure":"示意圖，並非冷凍電子顯微鏡重建或 AeroSense 結構","OR–Orco sensing mechanism and calcium-dependent GCaMP6f reporting":"OR–Orco 感測機制與依賴鈣離子的 GCaMP6f 報導","Vertical sensing mechanism":"直向感測機制","Figure 2. Linear maps of Module 1 and Module 2.":"圖 2。模組 1 與模組 2 的線性構築圖。","Zboray overlap":"與 Zboray 重疊","No overlap":"未重疊","Selected":"已選取","Two modules, one backbone":"雙模組，共用骨架","Module 1: receptor cassette":"模組 1：受體表現盒","Module 2: reporter cassette":"模組 2：報導表現盒","Only the OR coding sequence changes across the nine sensing plasmids. Select a feature below for its role and caveats.":"九種感測質體僅更換 OR 編碼序列。選取下方元件，即可查看其功能與限制。","One reporter plasmid encodes a single fusion protein. Select a feature below for its role and caveats.":"一個報導質體編碼一條融合蛋白。選取下方元件，即可查看其功能與限制。","Select a labelled feature to read its role, rationale and caveats.":"選取標示的元件，即可查看其功能、設計依據與限制。","Feature notes":"元件說明","Select a feature in Figure 2 to view its notes.":"選取圖 2 的元件，即可查看說明。","One panel, nine receptors":"同一面板，九種受體","Select a receptor to see its identity and overlap with the Zboray comparator panel.":"選取受體，查看其名稱及是否與 Zboray 比較面板重疊。","Select a receptor to check its overlap with the seven-receptor Zboray et al. comparator panel. A badge describes overlap, not a validated ligand response. Shared panel facts are in":"選取受體，查看其是否與 Zboray 等人的七受體比較面板重疊。標籤只代表面板重疊，不代表已驗證的配體反應。共通設計資訊請見","AeroSense couples insect odorant-receptor design to a calcium-dependent fluorescence readout in HEK293 cells. The selected architecture combines nine tuning-receptor plasmids with one shared GCaMP6f–(GGGGS) 3 –DmOrco reporter plasmid on pcDNA3.1(+). The sensing cassette produces a separate IRES-dependent mCherry marker; the reporter cassette encodes one fusion protein. This page records the architecture and sequence checks. Results presents the acquired cellular measurements.":"AeroSense 在 HEK293 細胞中，將昆蟲嗅覺受體設計與鈣離子依賴的螢光讀值結合。選定架構包含九種調諧受體質體，以及一個以 pcDNA3.1(+) 為骨架的共用 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)₃–DmOrco 報導質體。感測表現匣產生獨立的 IRES 依賴 mCherry 標記；報導表現匣則編碼單一融合蛋白。本頁記錄架構與序列檢查，已取得的細胞量測見 Results。","AeroSense couples insect odorant-receptor design to a calcium-dependent fluorescence readout in HEK293 cells. The selected architecture combines nine tuning-receptor plasmids with one shared GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)3–DmOrco reporter plasmid on pcDNA3.1(+). The sensing cassette produces a separate IRES-dependent mCherry marker; the reporter cassette encodes one fusion protein. This page records the architecture and sequence checks. Results presents the acquired cellular measurements.":"AeroSense 在 HEK293 細胞中，將昆蟲嗅覺受體設計與鈣離子依賴的螢光讀值結合。選定架構包含九種調諧受體質體，以及一個以 pcDNA3.1(+) 為骨架的共用 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)₃–DmOrco 報導質體。感測表現匣產生獨立的 IRES 依賴 mCherry 標記；報導表現匣則編碼單一融合蛋白。本頁記錄架構與序列檢查，已取得的細胞量測見 Results。","The Sense-layer design uses a common expression context to make receptor outputs comparable.":"感測層設計使用共用表現條件，使各受體輸出具可比較性。","Nine tuning-receptor plasmids pair with the same GCaMP6f–Orco reporter design. The map shows their shared architecture.":"九種調諧受體質體搭配相同的 GCaMP6f–Orco 報導設計；圖中呈現其共用架構。","GCaMP6f is fused to Orco’s intracellular N-terminus as one polypeptide. The fusion replaced an IRES-driven reporter architecture because downstream IRES expression is reduced relative to the upstream cistron. OR–Orco channel assembly provides the mechanistic rationale. The Parts catalogue records the sequences and Registry packaging. [3] Ibrahimi et al., 2009 — full entry in References. [1]":"GCaMP6f 與 Orco 的細胞內 N 端融合為單一多肽。因 IRES 下游表現低於上游順反子，融合設計取代了 IRES 驅動的報導架構。OR–Orco 通道組裝提供機制依據；序列與 Registry 元件收錄於 Parts 目錄。 [3] [1]","mCherry is translated from the receptor transcript as a separate protein. Red fluorescence above matched background supports cassette expression. Results explains the distinction between reporter expression and receptor function.":"mCherry 由受體轉錄本轉譯為獨立蛋白；高於配對背景的紅色螢光支持表現匣表現。Results 說明報導蛋白表現與受體功能的差異。","The panel shares its expression context; tuning-receptor identity is the intended biological variable.":"受體組合共用表現條件，調諧受體身分為預定改變的生物變項。","Or85b and Or98a overlap with the seven-receptor panel characterized by Zboray et al.; the other seven receptors in our panel do not. This comparison describes overlap with that study. [5] Zboray et al., 2023 — full entry in References.":"Or85b 與 Or98a 和 Zboray 等人研究的七受體組合重疊；我們的其餘七種受體則不重疊。此比較描述與該研究的組合重疊情形。 [5]","Zboray et al. reported lines that expressed well and responded to VUAA1 without responding to the tested VOC panel. This motivated separate interpretation of expression, Orco activation and ligand response.":"Zboray 等人報告部分細胞株表現良好且對 VUAA1 有反應，卻未對測試的 VOC 組合反應。這促使我們分別判讀表現、Orco 活化與配體反應。","The P2 data provide the project’s acquired stimulus-response record.":"P2 資料提供本專題已取得的刺激反應紀錄。","N-terminal placement puts GCaMP6f on the cytoplasmic side of Orco, following published receptor topology.":"依據已發表的受體拓樸，N 端配置將 GCaMP6f 放在 Orco 的細胞質側。","Design hypothesis: tethering places the sensor near channel-associated Ca²⁺ entry. Its effect on folding and channel function is unmeasured.":"設計假說：繫接使感測蛋白靠近通道相關的 Ca²⁺ 進入位置；其對摺疊與通道功能的影響未量測。","The construct retains the parent GCaMP6f plasmid’s short RSET leader (His 6 + T7 tag + Xpress epitope) . The expected full-length fusion is approximately 105 kDa .":"構築保留親代 GCaMP6f 質體的短 RSET 前導序列（His₆ + T7 標籤 + Xpress 表位）；預期完整融合蛋白約為 105 kDa。","The construct retains the parent GCaMP6f plasmid’s short RSET leader (His6 + T7 tag + Xpress epitope). The expected full-length fusion is approximately 105 kDa.":"構築保留親代 GCaMP6f 質體的短 RSET 前導序列（His₆ + T7 標籤 + Xpress 表位）；預期完整融合蛋白約為 105 kDa。","The selected backbone omits WPRE. The associated documentation is collected on Safety and Security.":"選定骨架未包含 WPRE；相關文件彙整於 Safety and Security。","The selected backbone omits WPRE. The associated documentation is collected on Safety and Security .":"選定骨架未包含 WPRE；相關文件彙整於 Safety and Security。","The selected architecture addresses expression and measurement separately. This table records each design choice and its rationale.":"選定架構分別處理表現與量測；下表記錄各設計選擇及理由。","The assay logic separates cassette expression, reporter behavior and receptor-dependent response. Experiments records the methods and reference protocols; Results defines the evidence limits.":"檢測邏輯區分表現匣表現、報導蛋白行為與受體依賴反應。Experiments 記錄方法與參考流程；Results 說明證據限制。","Construct constraints":"構築限制","No receptor epitope tag. Final OR constructs carry no FLAG or trafficking tag, preserving the minimal receptor sequence. Published N-terminal rhodopsin tags and ER-export signals provide the comparison context for this design choice. [9] Miazzi et al., 2019 — full entry in References.":"受體未帶表位標籤。最終 OR 構築不含 FLAG 或運輸標籤，以保留精簡受體序列。已發表的 N 端視紫紅質標籤與 ER 輸出訊號提供此設計選擇的比較背景。 [9]","Panel coverage. Seven of nine receptors are outside the Zboray et al. comparator panel. The P2 record documents the project’s acquired VOC observations.":"組合涵蓋範圍。九種受體中有七種不在 Zboray 等人的比較組合內。P2 紀錄保存本專題已取得的 VOC 觀察。","Role and rationale for each labelled cassette feature.":"各個已標註表現匣元件的作用與設計理由。","Sequence choice. Final OR constructs carry no FLAG or trafficking tag. See construct constraints.":"序列選擇。最終 OR 構築不含 FLAG 或運輸標籤；詳見構築限制。","Sequence choice. Final OR constructs carry no FLAG or trafficking tag. See construct constraints .":"序列選擇。最終 OR 構築不含 FLAG 或運輸標籤；詳見構築限制。","Interpretation. mCherry marks cassette expression. Reporter and functional evidence are distinguished in Results.":"判讀。mCherry 標記表現匣表現；Results 區分報導蛋白與功能證據。","Interpretation. mCherry marks cassette expression. Reporter and functional evidence are distinguished in Results .":"判讀。mCherry 標記表現匣表現；Results 區分報導蛋白與功能證據。","Design rationale. Retained from the parent GCaMP6f plasmid; expected full-length fusion approximately 105 kDa.":"設計理由。保留自親代 GCaMP6f 質體；預期完整融合蛋白約為 105 kDa。","Sequence record. The leader is included in the annotated reporting cassette.":"序列紀錄。前導序列包含於已標註的報導表現匣。","Design map of synthesized cassettes":"合成表現匣設計圖","Accessible cassette list matching Figure 2":"與圖 2 對應的表現匣清單","Concept illustration":"概念示意圖","Cassette design map":"表現匣設計圖","Topology schematic":"拓樸示意圖","AeroSense couples insect odorant-receptor design to a calcium-dependent fluorescence readout in HEK293 cells. The selected architecture combines nine tuning-receptor plasmids with one shared GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)":"AeroSense 在 HEK293 細胞中，將昆蟲嗅覺受體設計與鈣離子依賴的螢光讀值結合。選定架構包含九種調諧受體質體，以及一個共用 GCaMP6f–(GGGGS)","–DmOrco reporter plasmid on pcDNA3.1(+). The sensing cassette produces a separate IRES-dependent mCherry marker; the reporter cassette encodes one fusion protein. This page records the architecture and sequence checks.":"–DmOrco 報導質體，以 pcDNA3.1(+) 為骨架。感測表現匣產生獨立的 IRES 依賴 mCherry 標記；報導表現匣則編碼單一融合蛋白。本頁記錄架構與序列檢查。","presents the acquired cellular measurements.":"呈現已取得的細胞量測。","GCaMP6f is fused to Orco’s intracellular N-terminus as one polypeptide. The fusion replaced an IRES-driven reporter architecture because downstream IRES expression is reduced relative to the upstream cistron. OR–Orco channel assembly provides the mechanistic rationale. The":"GCaMP6f 與 Orco 的細胞內 N 端融合為單一多肽。因 IRES 下游表現低於上游順反子，融合設計取代了 IRES 驅動的報導架構。OR–Orco 通道組裝提供機制依據。","records the sequences and Registry packaging.":"記錄序列與 Registry 元件。","mCherry is translated from the receptor transcript as a separate protein. Red fluorescence above matched background supports cassette expression.":"mCherry 由受體轉錄本轉譯為獨立蛋白。高於配對背景的紅色螢光支持表現匣表現。","explains the distinction between reporter expression and receptor function.":"說明報導蛋白表現與受體功能的差異。","Or85b and Or98a overlap with the seven-receptor panel characterized by Zboray et al.; the other seven receptors in our panel do not. This comparison describes overlap with that study.":"Or85b 與 Or98a 和 Zboray 等人研究的七受體組合重疊；我們的其餘七種受體則不重疊。此比較描述與該研究的組合重疊情形。","P2 data":"P2 資料","provide the project’s acquired stimulus-response record.":"提供本專題已取得的刺激反應紀錄。","Design hypothesis:":"設計假說：","tethering places the sensor near channel-associated Ca²⁺ entry. Its effect on folding and channel function is unmeasured.":"繫接使感測蛋白靠近通道相關的 Ca²⁺ 進入位置；其對摺疊與通道功能的影響未量測。","The construct retains the parent GCaMP6f plasmid’s short":"構築保留親代 GCaMP6f 質體的短","RSET leader (His":"RSET 前導序列（His","+ T7 tag + Xpress epitope)":"+ T7 標籤 + Xpress 表位）",". The expected full-length fusion is approximately":"。預期完整融合蛋白約為","105 kDa":"105 kDa","The selected backbone omits WPRE. The associated documentation is collected on":"選定骨架未包含 WPRE。相關文件彙整於","The assay logic separates cassette expression, reporter behavior and receptor-dependent response.":"檢測邏輯區分表現匣表現、報導蛋白行為與受體依賴反應。","records the methods and reference protocols;":"記錄方法與參考流程；","defines the evidence limits.":"說明證據限制。","No receptor epitope tag.":"受體未帶表位標籤。","Final OR constructs carry no FLAG or trafficking tag, preserving the minimal receptor sequence. Published N-terminal rhodopsin tags and ER-export signals provide the comparison context for this design choice.":"最終 OR 構築不含 FLAG 或運輸標籤，以保留精簡受體序列。已發表的 N 端視紫紅質標籤與 ER 輸出訊號提供此設計選擇的比較背景。","Panel coverage.":"組合涵蓋範圍。","Seven of nine receptors are outside the Zboray et al. comparator panel. The":"九種受體中有七種不在 Zboray 等人的比較組合內。","P2 record":"P2 紀錄","documents the project’s acquired VOC observations.":"保存本專題已取得的 VOC 觀察。","Sequence choice.":"序列選擇。","Final OR constructs carry no FLAG or trafficking tag. See":"最終 OR 構築不含 FLAG 或運輸標籤。詳見","construct constraints":"構築限制","Interpretation.":"判讀。","mCherry marks cassette expression. Reporter and functional evidence are distinguished in":"mCherry 標記表現匣表現。報導蛋白與功能證據的區別見","Retained from the parent GCaMP6f plasmid; expected full-length fusion approximately 105 kDa.":"保留自親代 GCaMP6f 質體；預期完整融合蛋白約為 105 kDa。","Sequence record.":"序列紀錄。","The leader is included in the annotated reporting cassette.":"前導序列包含於已標註的報導表現匣。","Design overview":"設計總覽","AeroSense biological design: receptor focus and future extensions":"AeroSense 生物設計：受體核心與未來延伸","The current path runs from VOCs to OR and Orco in HEK293 cells, calcium entry, GCaMP6f fluorescence and optical readout. Receptor engineering is the current focus. Dashed branches identify future OBP delivery and cell-free sensing, with exosomes as one candidate carrier.":"目前路徑從 VOCs 經 HEK293 細胞內的 OR 與 Orco、鈣離子流入、GCaMP6f 螢光到光學讀值，聚焦於受體工程。虛線分支標示未來的 OBP 傳遞與無細胞感測構想；外泌體為候選載體之一。","Receptor focus and future extensions":"受體核心與未來延伸","VOCs feed the current HEK293 receptor and fluorescence design. Future OBP delivery and cell-free sensing branch from this path; exosomes are a candidate carrier.":"VOCs 進入目前的 HEK293 受體與螢光設計。未來 OBP 傳遞與無細胞感測由此路徑延伸；外泌體為候選載體。","CURRENT FOCUS · RECEPTOR":"目前聚焦 · 受體工程","OR + Orco in HEK293":"HEK293 內的 OR + Orco","Nine ORs · one reporter architecture":"九種 OR · 共用報導架構","Odor input":"氣味輸入","Optical readout":"光學讀值","Receptor response pattern":"受體反應圖譜","Read future work on OBPs":"閱讀 OBP 的未來研究構想","Odor delivery":"氣味傳遞","Read future work on cell-free sensing":"閱讀無細胞感測的未來研究構想","Cell-free sensing":"無細胞感測","Exosomes: candidate carrier":"外泌體：候選載體","A receptor-centered design.":"以受體為核心的設計。","Our current focus is the receptor layer: nine ORs share the same HEK293 chassis and GCaMP6f–Orco reporter. Dashed branches connect the broader design to":"我們目前聚焦於受體層：九種 OR 共用 HEK293 宿主與 GCaMP6f–Orco 報導架構。虛線分支將整體設計連到","Two extensions build on the receptor layer: improving odor delivery and moving sensing beyond a living-cell chassis.":"以受體層為基礎，延伸兩個方向：改善氣味傳遞，以及將感測移至活細胞以外的平台。","Evaluate odorant-binding proteins as an optional delivery module between the sample and the receptor. Compare matched VOC exposures with and without a defined OBP to determine whether capture and release improve the receptor response.":"評估氣味結合蛋白，作為樣本與受體之間的選配傳遞模組。在相同 VOC 暴露條件下，比較加入特定 OBP 與未加入 OBP 的反應，判斷捕捉與釋放是否改善受體訊號。","Explore a membrane-based receptor platform outside living cells. Exosomes are one candidate carrier. Platform selection would compare receptor incorporation, signal generation and stability under matched odor exposure.":"探索活細胞以外、以膜為基礎的受體平台，外泌體是候選載體之一。平台選擇將在相同氣味暴露條件下，比較受體嵌入、訊號產生與穩定性。","Abstract":"摘要","Design requirements":"設計需求","Sensing mechanism":"感測機制","Current architecture":"目前架構","Receptor panel & standardization":"受體面板與標準化","Design decisions":"設計決策","Assay design":"檢測設計","Interpretation":"結果解讀","Conclusion":"結論","Data and resources":"資料與資源","References":"參考資料"});
